  "narrative": {
    "intro": "Patriot Contract Services has $301M in contract obligations in FY2026 to date, spread across 252 awards with an average award size of $1.2M. Patriot Contract Services obligations are down 13.1% year over year. Patriot Contract Services obligated amounts have varied by fiscal year: $219M in FY21, $336M in FY22, $371M in FY23, $444M in FY24, $347M in FY25, and $301M in FY26. Patriot Contract Services receives the largest shares of FY2026 to date obligations from the Department of Defense with $169M and the Department of Transportation with $132M. Patriot Contract Services current-year totals are partial because the fiscal year is still in progress, and the figures shown are contract obligations except where table notes identify award values as total contract values. Patriot Contract Services reporting focuses on obligations and buying-agency concentration, giving a concise view of federal demand and recent-year movement in contract funding.",
